{"id":"H8048","lemma":"שַׁמָּה","transliteration":"shammah","sayIt":"sham-MAH","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Shammah","meaning":"A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.36.13;\nson of: Reuel (H7467);\nbrother of: Nahath (H5184), Zerah (H2226) and Mizzah (H4199)\n§ Shammah = \"astonishment\"\n1) son of Reuel, grandson of Esau, and a chief of Edom\n2) the 3rd son of Jesse and a brother of David\n3) son of Agee the Hararite and one of the 30 of David's mighty warriors\n4) the Harodite, one of the 30 of David's mighty warriors\n5) another Hararite, one of the 30 of David's mighty warriors","glosses":["shammah","son of shammah"],"count":7,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shammah","kjv":"Shammah"}},{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shammah","kjv":"Shammah"}},{"chapterId":"1sa-16","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shammah","kjv":"made Shammah"}},{"chapterId":"1sa-17","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"was Shammah","kjv":"Shammah"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-23","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shammah","kjv":"Shammah"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-23","v":33,"renderings":{"bsb":"son of Shammah","kjv":"Shammah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":37,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shammah","kjv":"Shammah"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 36:13","note":"These are the sons of Reuel: Nahath, Zerah, Shammah, and Mizzah. These were the descendants of Basemath, Esau’s wife.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Samuel 16:9","note":"Then Jesse made Shammah to pass by. He said, “Yahweh has not chosen this one, either.”","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Samuel 23:25","note":"Shammah the Harodite, Elika the Harodite,","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 1:37","note":"The sons of Reuel: Nahath, Zerah, Shammah, and Mizzah.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H7681","lemma":"שָׁגֵה","transliteration":"shageh","gloss":"Shagee"},{"id":"H8054","lemma":"שַׁמּוֹת","transliteration":"shammot","gloss":"Shammoth"},{"id":"H8093","lemma":"שִׁמְעָה","transliteration":"shimah","glo